Package: phoenix-welcome
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Phoenix OS Project <build@phoenix-os.io>
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Phoenix OS Welcome Application
 First-boot onboarding and system overview application.
 Launches automatically on the first KDE Plasma session.
 Features:
  - System overview: hardware summary, OS version
  - Getting started guide for repair and recovery tools
  - Flatpak and Flathub configuration assistant
  - Phoenix Key detection and setup
  - Links to documentation and community resources
